# ES-MoE ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** MoE training system with expert offload to host memory/SSD and virtual-memory-style management.

**LEONES status:** P3.

## Summary

ES-MoE is primarily focused on training beyond GPU memory. Its techniques are nevertheless relevant to the broader ODS research into memory tiers, expert placement, offload and prefetch.

## ODS fit

It should not be treated as a production inference backend. The useful parts are the memory-management techniques that could inform future runtime strategies.

**Classification:** P3 research reference.